      "id": 31,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Direct-to-vLLM Requests (unmetered)",
      "description": "Requests vLLM completed in the selected range that did not come through llm-gateway. Should stay at 0; vLLM rejects calls without the gateway-only key. Up to about 16 can show briefly while long requests are in flight.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
